WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:06.600
There must be malicious traitors in Qing Province deliberately stirring unrest to sabotage imperial policy and incite revolt.

00:07.320 --> 00:10.200
Eldest Brother was simply framed by deceitful schemers!

00:11.000 --> 00:18.000
Your son will launch a rigorous investigation, seize the conspirators, and have the Imperial Guard pass judgment—then this matter can finally be laid to rest.

00:21.760 --> 00:24.000
Good... very good indeed.
